OL,3,GNEWSAFree SAD lamps given out as
OL,4,Adisorder 'makes it hard to do anything
OL,5,Aon darker days'
OL,6,
OL,7,FDoes your mood drop in the winter?
OL,9,FThe clocks have gone back, it's getting
OL,10,Fdarker and colder, which could mean you
OL,11,Fmay find the winter months particularly
OL,12,Fhard.
OL,14,FRachel Dineem-Mabe is one of more than
OL,15,Fa million people with Seasonal
OL,16,FAffective Disorder (SAD) in the UK, and
OL,17,Fsays it "takes depression and heightens
OL,18,Fit to a whole new level".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
