OL,3,GNEWSAFree SAD lamps given out as
OL,4,Adisorder 'makes it hard to do anything
OL,5,Aon darker days'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut a new scheme allowing people to
OL,8,Fborrow SAD lamps from libraries has
OL,9,Fbeen launched across Wales to help
OL,10,Fcombat the darker days.
